        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Duipang ramgai ai guangtang pukhou,",
            "Kandih man kan nimei ta ning lak khe;",
            "Hei kandih apumta ning lakkhe,",
            "Ringmei thingbang pou Khrista ta ning e.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "He ning e poubaumei ram 1@:,",
            "Khou lung rianra nai ldat lak khe;",
            "Akhang chamdanmei duipang ramkhou,",
            "Thaodat kanmei guai bammpui ram1@:.",
            "",
            "2. Hei ram 1@: ninga achun si e,",
            "Laujiu Nah le kanloumei bampui ram;",
            "Hei kandih ta gan louna tat ni,",
            "Hei ram 1@: ai guangtang puni e.",
            "",
            "3. Kaniu hukhou 1@: gan puni e,",
            "Tuna samei khuan 1@: chulou lana;",
            "Kandih rianra pap gei pui ram 1@:,",
            "Tuan puni hei ram guangtang pukhou.",
            "",
            "4. Khou 1@: khanga tat kanmei guai 1@:,",
            "Rianramei guai rui neilana bamme;",
            "Kanloumeipu le kanloumei guai,",
            "He tam maknga bam nipui ram khou."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
